  "mismatch_cause": "Both are radio/PHY windows whose baseline is COLD (pre-phy_enable). The resident firmware on this board had already brought the PHY up, and a JTAG `reset halt` is a software core reset that does not cold-reset peripherals. A reset deep enough to cold-reset the radio (RTC_CNTL SW_SYS_RST) also resets the USB-Serial-JTAG bridge and drops the debug link \u2014 verified, the write fails with LIBUSB_ERROR_IO. Re-corroborating these two needs a C3 with no PHY-enabling firmware resident, or an external JTAG probe."
 },
